---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">San Diego Corporate Wellness</div><h1>Corporate fitness and wellness in San Diego.</h1><p class="lead">San Diego companies have a strong opportunity to build healthier teams with programs that combine movement, recovery, nutrition education and mental performance support.</p></div></section>
<section class="content"><div class="container"><article>

<h2>A wellness program built for active San Diego teams</h2><p>San Diego has a health-conscious culture, but many employees still spend most of the day sitting, commuting or working under stress. A corporate wellness program should help people move better, recover better and build habits that last.</p><h2>Program ideas for San Diego companies</h2><ul><li>Weekly guided workouts employees can complete at home, outside or in a small office gym.</li><li>Mobility sessions for desk posture, hips, shoulders and back care.</li><li>Nutrition education around energy, protein, hydration and recovery.</li><li>Mental performance practices that support focus, confidence and stress management.</li><li>Team wellness challenges that encourage consistency without being extreme.</li></ul><h2>Local content angle</h2><p>This page can be expanded with examples for San Diego tech companies, schools, athletic teams, healthcare groups and hybrid workplaces. Add a local call-to-action once the business model is ready.</p><div class="callout"><strong>Content angle:</strong> This page should connect the topic back to the app naturally. Mention guided training, body care, nutrition education and mental performance where relevant without forcing a sales pitch.</div>
</article></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
